   :unreachable/observed "top page answers HTTP 200 (2026-08-22); per-entity company-register extracts sit behind paid/POST flows"
   :unreachable/consequence "The company-law register entry (sheet 286, folio 64, Companies Book no. 5, entry 1) is cited only as the issuer's own statement (row issuer-mercantile), not from the register itself."}
  {:unreachable/authority "Banco de Espana credit-institution register (entity code 0049)"
   :unreachable/url "https://www.bde.es/"
   :unreachable/observed "no stable per-entity GET URL for the register this gate can replay"
